    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふぅ〜、&lt;Ines&gt;が
鍵を持ってて助かったねぇ。
ここは&lt;Ines&gt;の部屋？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Phew~ lucky Ines had the key. Was this room yours?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>違うわ。
ここはシルバ大佐の娘……
ラピスの部屋よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No. This room belongs to Colonel Silver's daughter... Lapis.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この子が大佐の娘さん？
……という事は
&lt;Ines&gt;の子ども!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He has a daughter? Hang on... it's not YOURS is it?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ち、違うわよ!!
私と大佐はそんな関係じゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-of course not!! We didn't have that kind of relationship...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しっ、この子が起きるだろ！
せっかくよく寝てんのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shh, you'll wake the kid up! She's really out cold...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……何をしても起きないわ。
ラピスは、もう三年も
眠ったままなの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...She can't wake up, no matter what we do. She's been asleep for three years now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>デスピル病……か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Does she suffer from despir...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>違うわ。
ラピスとパールさん
……シルバ大佐の奥様は三年前</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No. Three years ago, Lapis and Pearl- Colonel Silver's wife...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>軍が教会に対抗するために
開発した、巨大思念石砲の
暴発事故に巻きこまれたの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They were both involved in an accident. The military was developing a giant Will stone cannon to counter the church but it... exploded.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その事件……覚えてる。
公開試射で大砲が爆発して
何十人も死傷者が出たんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait... I remember hearing about that. Weren't dozens of people injured or killed when a public test backfired?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>思念石砲の設計に関わっていた
大佐は、未完成な砲の
試射をとめようとしたけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Colonel was involved in the development of the cannon, and tried to stop the test firing of the unfinished prototype.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>軍は教会への対抗心から
公開試射を強行したのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the military insisted on a public test, to send the church a message.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人質のように開発者の家族を
試射に強制参加させて……ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They forced the development team's families to participate in the test firing, like hostages...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひでぇ……
それでシルバ大佐の奥さんは？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's twisted... what happened to his wife?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……亡くなったわ。誰よりも
大佐を信じていたパールさんは
最前列で試射を見ていたのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...She passed away. No one had more faith in the Colonel than her, so she sat in the front row to watch the test firing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>奇跡的に助かったラピスも
事故のショックで、目覚めない
眠りについてしまったの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was a miracle Lapis survived, but she fell unconscious  from the shock...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ソーマでなんとか
できないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Not even Soma could cure her?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私も何度も
ラピスにリンクしてみたわ。
でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've tried linking with her countless times, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………お願い。
みんな、ラピスに
スピルリンクしてくれないかしら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Please, will you all help me give Spirlinking another shot?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これはお詫びのプレゼントだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here, I brought you a present to say sorry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お前を目覚めさせる事もできない
ソーマだが、飾りとしてなら
きれいな物だろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if Soma can't wake you up, they still make a pretty accessory.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待っていなさい。
もうすぐだ……もうすぐパパが
目覚めさせてあげるからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just hang in there, sweetie. Soon... daddy's will to wake you up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51796</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もうママはいない世界だけど
代わりにパパが、お前を
本当のお姫様にしてあげるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mommy may not be with us anymore... Instead, I promise daddy will turn you into a real princess.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お前の夢……こんなに何枚も
絵を描いた、お姫様の王冠……
これをプレゼントしたら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a princess' crown... just like you always dreamt, like you drew pictures of all the time...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きっと嬉しくて目を覚まして
くれるだろう？　また大きな声で
笑ってくれるだろう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then you can wake up... and we can laugh together, like we used to.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……もうすぐだよ、ラピス。
それまでせめて、いい夢を
見ておくれ。私の『ねむり姫』……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Just a little longer, Lapis. Until then... sweet dreams, my little Sleeping Beauty...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;のソーマだ。
まさか、あいつ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's Kohaku's Soma. So, he...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大丈夫。大佐がリチアの力を
使うつもりなら、&lt;Kohaku&gt;の
協力は不可欠なんだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't worry. If the Colonel intends on using Lithia's powers, he'll need Kohaku' cooperation.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お姫様の絵なんて女の子なら
誰でも描くものなのに、それを
本気にするなんて、おかしいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Doesn't every little girl draw princesses and stuff? It's kinda weird he takes it so seriously.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おかしいけど…………
…………すごく悲しいね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's weird but... it's just too sad...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>彼が絶望の中でつかんだ
たったひとつの希望だったのよ。
一途で不器用な人なの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That was his only ray of hope in the sea of despair. In the end, he's just an honest, if awkward guy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな大佐にリチアの存在を教え
復讐と復活の幻想を吹きこんだのが
…………女魔道士インカローズ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The one that taught him about Lithia and filled his head with delusions of revenge and ressurection... was Incarose.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、私も同罪よ……
大佐の憎しみを
とめる事ができなかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I'm also to blame... I couldn't do anything to ease his hatred...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Ines&gt;が
シルバ大佐を好きになった理由が
少しわかったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Now I can kinda see why Ines would fall for him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56428</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだ間に合う。
ラピスのためにも
あの人をとめるんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it's not too late. We'll put a stop to him, for Lapis!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>インカローズが
リチア様の存在を教えただと？
だがシルバが『ヤツ』ならば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Incarose divulged the existence of Master Lithia? Then, if Silver is siding with “him”...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
